      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Turn flow:\n  1. ActionRouter classifies\n  2. EventManager advances clock\n  3. PlanExecutor branches by verb\n     (TALK / EXAMINE / MOVE / ATTACK \u2026)\n  4. NPCTurnResolver runs Actors\n  5. WorldChronicler updates threads\n  6. Narrator \u2192 prose\n  7. Dramaturge fact-checks (optional)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Turn flow:\n  1. ActionRouter classifies\n  2. EventManager advances clock\n  3. PlanExecutor branches by verb\n     (TALK / EXAMINE / MOVE / ATTACK \u2026)\n  4. NPCTurnResolver runs Actors\n  5. WorldChronicler updates threads\n  6. Narrator \u2192 prose\n  7. Dramaturge fact-checks (optional)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
